#====================================================================
# DRAFT-dwarves-public-header-shim-transitive.kv
# 库公开头直接 include musl 垫片头(obstack/argp)与 elfutils 头, OHOS 消费者
# 需显式 requires+link 传递依赖; 完整叙事与证据见同目录 .md
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT (proposed E-numbered, 最终编号由知识库主编确认)
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|conan_test
phase:                  packaging|testing
error_signature:        fatal error: .*(obstack\.h|argp\.h|dwarf\.h).* file not found|(musl-obstack|argp-standalone|elfutils)_INCLUDE_DIRS_RELEASE \)
severity:               2
category:               conan, cmake, packaging, musl-shim, headers
match_keywords:         conan, CMakeDeps, transitive dependency, public header, obstack, argp, dwarves, musl shim, elfutils, find_package, INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES, empty include, consumer, test_package, explicit requires
title:                  库公开头直接 include musl 垫片头(obstack/argp)与 elfutils 头时, OHOS 消费者仅 link 库 target 会因 CMakeDeps 传递依赖 include 元数据为空而编译失败, 需显式 requires+link 传递依赖
root_cause:             Conan 2 CMakeDeps 在消费端只对直接 requires 的包生成含 include dirs 的完整配置; 传递依赖包的 *-data.cmake 中 INCLUDE_DIRS_RELEASE 置空. dwarves.h 公开头第14-16行直接 #include <obstack.h>/<dwarf.h>/<elfutils/libdwfl.h>, OHOS-musl 由 musl-obstack/argp-standalone/elfutils 提供, 消费者仅 find_package(dwarves)+link dwarves::dwarves 时拿不到传递头路径. 库自身构建不报错(CMakeToolchain CMAKE_INCLUDE_PATH 兜底注入掩盖)
affected_scope:         公开头链 include musl 垫片头或第三方头(obstack/argp/libdw)的 Conan 2 library; OHOS-musl 目标; test_package 走 find_package+target_link_libraries 消费链
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/d/dwarves/1.30 -pr:h=<repo>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=<repo>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing --user=ohpcd --channel=stable; 修复前 fatal error: 'obstack.h' file not found 且 musl-obstack-<arch>-data.cmake 中 INCLUDE_DIRS_RELEASE 为空; 修复后 consumer 编译链接运行 OK (dwarves version: 130, consumer: OK), W3 L1 pass
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           consumer-explicit-transitive-require
rec_description:        消费者(如 test_package)在 requirements() 显式声明传递依赖 musl-obstack/argp-standalone/elfutils, CMakeLists 显式 find_package 并 link 对应 target; 避免仅依赖库 target 的隐式传递. 主配方 requirements 保留 requires 声明以传播链接关系
rec_command:            def requirements(self):\n    self.requires(self.tested_reference_str)\n    self.requires("musl-obstack/1.2.3")\n    self.requires("argp-standalone/1.5.0")\n    self.requires("elfutils/0.195")  # 公开头传递依赖 -> 消费者显式声明
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-conan-recipe
forbid_1_pattern:       CPATH.*obstack|CMAKE_INCLUDE_PATH.*dwarves
forbid_1_reason:        环境变量兜底破坏 Conan 依赖图声明式语义, 非可复现配置